  "nativeAdaptations": [
    "Use existing public AlertWith/EmptyWith and their current-child-context slots; no SDK state machine is added.",
    "Recipe/language choices follow the Gallery Flyout/system-menu route. Native menus keep platform styling.",
    "Material Symbols supply the configured native icon family, with fixed-size decorative icons omitted from the accessibility tree.",
    "Source href=# examples use real native Link roles and locally handled preview actions rather than launching an invalid external fragment.",
    "The source slash Kbd is a visual keycap; it does not silently install a global shortcut or steal editor input.",
    "Buttons and links update local application preview state. No payment processing, account save, network upload, message delivery or notification fetch is performed.",
    "Original source avatar bytes are reused from the committed Card assets and converted to grayscale in memory; no runtime image fetch or replacement portrait is used.",
    "Native row/list and inline link semantics replace DOM tags; selection/query/recipe drafts remain application-owned across page changes."
  ],
